.712646484375], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 25, "type": "Fast Groups Bypasser (rgthree)", "properties": {"customSortAlphabet": "", "matchColors": "", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "sort": "position", "matchTitle": "", "showNav": true, "toggleRestriction": "default"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["开源地址：\nhttps://modelscope.cn/models/Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-VoiceDesign\n\nQwen3 TTS 支持的语言：\n中文、英文、日文、韩文、德文、法文、俄文、葡萄牙文、西班牙文、意大利文\n\n\n基础声学特征\t\n性别/年龄：青年、中年、成熟、老年、少年、童声。\n音高：高亢、低沉、甜美、浑厚、清脆。\n音色：明亮、温暖、沙哑、有磁性、清亮、有颗粒感。\n语速与节奏：轻快、沉稳、急促、舒缓、抑扬顿挫。\n\n2. 语言表达特征\t\n说话的方式、语气和情感。\t\n情感与语气：欢快、温柔、冷静、严肃、热情、慵懒、忧郁、鼓励、兴奋。\n发音特点：字正腔圆、清晰、略带口音（如南方口音、台湾腔）、慵懒、干脆利落。\n表达风格：亲切的、专业的、知性的、活泼的、沉稳的、有说服力的、讲故事般的。\n\n3. 场景与角色\t\n声音适用的上下文，帮助模型定位。\t\n职业/角色：新闻主播、教师、医生、解说员、朋友、向导、智能助手、电影旁白。\n使用场景：儿童故事、深夜电台、商业广告、课堂讲解、ASMR、游戏角色。\n\nBasic acoustic characteristics\nGender/Age: Youth, middle age, maturity, old age, child, childlike voice.\nPitch: High-pitched, low-pitched, sweet, rich, crisp.\nTimbre: Bright, warm, hoarse, magnetic, clear, granular.\nSpeech rate and rhythm: Light and quick, steady and calm, rapid, gentle, with rising and falling tones. \n2. Language Expression Characteristics\nThe way of speaking, tone and emotions.\nEmotions and tones: cheerful, gentle, calm, serious, passionate, lazy, melancholic, encouraging, excited.\nPronunciation features: accurate and melodious, clear, with slight accents (such as southern accent, Taiwanese accent), languid, crisp and neat.\nExpression styles: friendly, professional, intellectual, lively, composed, persuasive, storytelling-like. \n3. Scenes and Characters\nThe context in which the voice is used helps the model determine the appropriate application.\nOccupation/Role: News anchor, teacher, doctor, commentator, friend, guide, intelligent assistant, movie narrator.\nUsage Scenarios: Children's stories, late-night radio, commercial advertisements, classroom explanations, ASMR, game characters.\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [496.94244384765625, 582.4141845703125], "pos": [-174.5125732421875, 447.192138671875], "id": 19, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [868.6140109497538, -432.6999518451496], "scale": 1.4122927695244514}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 50, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "Qwen3TTS 声音设计", "bounding": [392.0818176269531, 203.43487548828125, 1048.8599853515625, 837.193359375]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 50, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "Qwen3TTS 声音设计--多语言翻译", "bounding": [390.2554016113281, 1142.5491943359375, 2056.092529296875, 1027.7540283203125]}], "links": [[1, 2, 0, 1, 0, "QWEN3_TTS_MODEL"], [7, 1, 0, 9, 0, "AUDIO"], [15, 17, 0, 18, 0, "*"], [16, 10, 0, 1, 2, "STRING"], [17, 8, 0, 1, 1, "STRING"], [18, 22, 0, 20, 0, "QWEN3_TTS_MODEL"], [20, 24, 0, 20, 2, "STRING"], [21, 20, 0, 21, 0, "AUDIO"], [22, 23, 0, 17, 0, "STRING"], [23, 18, 0, 20, 1, "STRING"]], "id": "7bcec202-ffaf-4e86-8862-16737d09a62d", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 25, "revision": 0}